        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive into danger, sharpen your blade, and test your skill.</strong> <br>  <br><strong>The Treasure Below</strong> is a third person action game with stylized medieval  visuals, satisfying melee combat, and ever-increasing challenges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a <strong>variety of weapons</strong>, each with unique attacks and skills—fast moving swords, long reaching polearms, heavy-hitting great axes, and more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arena Mode</strong> puts your skill to the test: fight through escalating <strong>waves of monsters</strong>, each deadlier than the last. Survive long enough, and you’ll earn access to <strong>greater rewards</strong> and tougher challenges.<br><br><strong>Adventure Mode</strong> Descend into dangerous dungeons and uncover ancient treasures in a series of handcrafted levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Co-op</strong> Team up with a friend to take on monsters together. No PvP—just pure cooperative action.<br><br>There’s <strong>no story, no lore, no cutscenes</strong>—just pure gameplay. Jump in, gear up, and see how far you can go.</p>",
